WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:03.940
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start!

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.680
When watching Kaleido Star,
please keep the room brightly lit,

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.340
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.450
I'm Sora Naegino.
I came to America all by myself

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.150
with aspirations of joining Kaleido Stage.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.920
Everything is new to me,

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.390
but I'm doing my best in the spirit of
"try it rather than think about it."

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:22.790
There's nothing I can't do if I try

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.590
and if I can do it without trying,
I'd be super lucky.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.690
And if I'm gonna do it, I just gotta do it!
Gotta! Gotta! That's me.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.930
Well, well, well, does everyone know
the story of "The Little Mermaid?"

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:34.700
It's a really wonderful story.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.710
This time, I'm going to attempt to get
the leading part,

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.340
but I make a mistake and have a really
scary experience.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.240
And I can't get it out of my mind.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.810
Oh! I've really found myself in a pinch
this time! I have! I have!

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:05.930
<i>What is it that you want to do?</i>

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:05.930
<i>Yaritai koto wa nani</i>

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:09.600
<i>Every time I was asked that</i>

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:09.600
<i>Sou kikareru tabi</i>

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:13.330
<i>I looked up at the blue sky</i>

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:13.330
<i>Aoi sora miageta</i>

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.310
<i>The answer is only in my heart</i>

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.310
<i>Kotae wa only my heart</i>

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>I don't easily say the words
that are really important</i>

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Honto ni daiji na kotoba wa
kantan ni wa iwanai</i>

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:32.160
<i>I start running towards the place
the light points to</i>

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:32.160
<i>Hikari ga yubisasu basho e to hashiridasu yo</i>

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:40.100
<i>There's so much in my heart that I want
to embrace, I could cry</i>

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:40.100
<i>Dakishimetai mono nara
nakitai hodo mune ni aru</i>

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:47.080
<i>I'll keep painting my way, I promise,
take it someday</i>

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:47.080
<i>Egakitsuzukete yuku kitto
take it someday</i>

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:55.050
<i>Beyond the horizon, where
the white clouds drift</i>

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:55.050
<i>Shiroi kumo ga nagareru
chiheisen no mukou ni</i>

00:01:55.050 --> 00:02:06.790
<i>The future is lined up and
it'll always be there by my side</i>

00:01:55.050 --> 00:02:06.790
<i>Naranderu mirai wa itsumo soba ni aru kara</i>

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.220
Dad!

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.690
I brought you lunch!

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.320
Thank you, Marion.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.100
Everyone, it's time for lunch!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.330
Yeah!

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.860
Why don't we sit here today?

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:58.010
Well, I'm going to read you the story of
"The Little Mermaid" today.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:03.320
"Once upon a time, there was a very
beautiful mermaid princess."

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:07.760
My Amazing Challenge For the Lead Role

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.630
My Amazing Challenge For the Lead Role

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.630
"My Amazing Challenge For the Lead Role"

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.620
My Amazing Challenge For the Lead Role

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:18.870
Thank you for coming to see us at
Kaleido Stage today.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:22.270
Due to stage equipment maintenance,

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:25.010
the performance of Cinderella will be
suspended for two weeks.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.170
We look forward to when
you come visit us again.

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:30.510
Great work, everyone!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:37.550
Finally, the vacation that we've dreamed
of will start tomorrow.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.450
Do the two of you have any plans?

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:40.590
Practice.

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.320
To be ready for the audition.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.190
Huh?

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.660
There's going to be an audition
on the last day of vacation...

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.800
Wait, you don't know?

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.130
No, I don't. No, I don't.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.400
Why am I the only one who doesn't know?!

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.100
It should be posted on the
dorm bulletin board.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.100
Why am I the only one who doesn't know?!

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.770
It should be posted on the
dorm bulletin board.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:54.370
Oh! So, what's posted?

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:56.170
Since last summer's performance
was so popular,

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.540
they're going to stage it again.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.810
"The Little Mermaid"!

00:03:58.810 --> 00:03:59.370
No way!

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:00.580
Oops.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:00.580
No way!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.880
What?

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.550
I've only seen this on video!

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.210
Oh, I can't believe this! Really?!

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.550
I'll get to see the real thing!

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.620
I'm so happy!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:09.780
It's a real tear jerker, you know?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:10.990
Especially at the end,
when the Little Mermaid

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:12.820
jumps off the ship into the ocean!

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.790
It'll make you cry a river no matter
how many times you see it!

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:15.590
There, there.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.890
Since Miss Layla is going to try a
new swing maneuver this time,

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.520
the cast auditions seem mainly for
people who are good on swings too.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.130
Really?

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.700
This is your chance, Sora!

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.370
What?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.070
It's your specialty, after all.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:29.200
Is it my specialty?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.770
Sora, you're the one who mastered
the Golden Phoenix.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:32.540
Well...

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.310
You could get the supporting role
right off the bat!

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:35.780
You think so?

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.010
Maybe I will make a serious effort.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:39.280
You could get a raise while you're at it!

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.720
Really?!

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.750
You'll get chauffeured
to and from work everyday!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.450
I don't know if I should be spoiled so much.

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:46.990
I can't believe her.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:48.750
She's already acting like she's
passed the audition.

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.220
It's like, she makes me sick.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:58.970
"So, in order to get a human body,
the Little Mermaid..."

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.130
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.470
Well...

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.310
How is the preparation for the
production going?

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.280
Everything is going smoothly.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.910
I see, very good.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.980
Then, since I am busy,

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.810
I want to see the performance right now.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.920
The audition is scheduled
to be held in two weeks.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:19.920
Quiet!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.260
I want to see it right this minute!

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:25.860
If I can't see it right now,
I will call the whole thing off!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.850
No, if you would settle for only my
scene, I could show you right away.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.870
Are you displeased with me for some reason?

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:37.440
No, you're a wonderful star and
I'm very aware of that.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:41.670
However, don't you have any stars
other than Layla?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.430
He's so nasty.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:47.370
He's like the sea witch in the Little Mermaid.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.380
Well, how about it?

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:58.010
This will be a special audition
in front of a client.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:00.500
If you successfully complete this audition,

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.730
you will be given the part of the
Little Mermaid on the spot,

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.870
and you will play the leading role
in this production.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.370
However, if you fail, the Little Mermaid
performance will be cancelled.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.630
Is there anybody who will
accept this challenge even then?

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.940
He said if she fails,
the show will be cancelled.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:14.470
It sounds like, super bad and risky.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.740
Isn't there anybody who'll
accept this challenge?

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.280
Why don't you take this opportunity to
try for the part of the Little Mermaid?

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.920
It's the leading part. The leading part!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.780
What? The leading part, huh?

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:23.650
Oh-ho...

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.290
Oh? What's going on?

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:26.750
That settles it then.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.620
Sora, play the part of the Little
Mermaid right this minute.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:30.690
What?!

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:33.600
But isn't the Little Mermaid Miss Layla's role?

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:34.530
So what?

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.100
You said you were good at swings
just a while ago.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.070
You sounded like, so confident.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.160
Really...

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.300
And you said if you got the part,

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.740
you'd get them to raise your pay
by ten times.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:45.310
What?!

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:46.910
And buy a tropical island...

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:47.980
What?!

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.110
I see.

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.010
If you've planned that far ahead,

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.580
I'll really have you play the part of
the Little Mermaid.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:54.720
What?!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:58.120
WHAT?!

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.470
Is everything ready?

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:29.620
Yes, sir.

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.520
Hey, Ken, what do I need to do?

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.860
Don't worry, Sora.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.320
I'll explain the details
of the performance to you now.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.460
From where you're standing now,

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:39.830
you just need to use that swing

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.190
to jump to the swing on the other side.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:45.030
When I press the buzzer, jump out there.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:49.090
Then your timing will match with the
swing on the other side of the waterfall.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.770
What? What waterfall?

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:53.430
What?

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:54.810
What?!

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:57.130
WHAT?!

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:01.950
Well, well...

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:03.180
Okay, begin!

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.190
Yes, sir.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.210
We're starting.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.120
Don't worry.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.780
I'm sure you'll be able to pull it off, Sora.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:12.320
Well, you tell me not to worry, but...

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.460
I can't see the other side because of
the waterfall. What am I gonna do?

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:24.460
No, let's just give it a try
instead of thinking about it!

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.270
Sora!

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.410
No, too late! Come back!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:46.620
Good, I can do it.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.030
What?

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:03.470
What? I didn't make it?

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.210
It's over...

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:35.630
Good, you're awake.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.600
You saved me?

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:38.850
Yes.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.710
From the look of it, you should be fine now.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.650
Oh, yes. Thank you.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.780
Then, I'll be leaving now.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.290
What?

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.980
Excuse me, where are you going?

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.560
Our castle, Kaleido Stage.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:54.930
Then, me too.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:57.830
You cannot come this way.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:09:59.060
Why...

00:09:59.330 --> 00:09:59.660
Huh?

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:01.640
What?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:04.570
You cannot come to our world.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.970
You should go back to the world
that you belong to.

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:10.740
Oh, wait!

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:14.880
Please wait! Wait! Wait!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:16.640
Wait...

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:20.040
Oh, she came to.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:22.480
Hey, you seem okay!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.390
Thank goodness.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.260
I still have them!

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:27.400
What are you talking about?

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:29.930
Ouch! Ouch...

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:32.400
Come on, you should still take it easy.

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:35.470
They said that you dislocated your
shoulder just a little.

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.110
But if Mr. Yuri hadn't been there,

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:39.110
you would've suffered a lot more
than a dislocated shoulder.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.040
What?

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.500
Yuri rescued you in the nick of time.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.510
I'd never seen real mouth-to-mouth
resuscitation before.

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:51.850
So, that wasn't a dream.

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:53.990
And then, and then, when Ken saw that...

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:55.790
Oh, yeah, Ken got...

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.620
Yeah, Ken got...

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:58.960
What?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.800
Sora, what are you doing?!

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:05.170
What?

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:06.790
Don't "What?" me!

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:08.740
Don't push yourself, Sora!

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.770
The doctor still doesn't want you to do
anything, remember?!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.170
I'll be fine.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.080
If I don't show Mr. Kenneth that I can
do this soon,

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.700
they'll cancel the show.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.610
Huh?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.440
Huh? What's wrong?

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:27.290
Huh? What? Huh?

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:30.280
Something's wrong... Huh? What?

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.090
Wha...

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:37.790
Sora. Sora. Can you hear me, Sora?

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.500
Huh? What just...

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.400
Sora, you have to take it easy.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:43.700
Right. I'm sorry.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.730
I think today's not a good day for me.

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:47.760
I'll go home and rest for today.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.270
Wait, Sora.

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:50.340
What?

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:52.310
I want you to be honest with me.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:55.450
Sora, could it be that you're afraid?

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:59.150
Is that it after all?

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:02.160
Sora, if you're afraid...

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.090
Leave me alone!

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:04.520
Don't mind me!

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:06.660
Please stop her right away.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.400
Oh, Sora...

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.130
What?

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.120
Sora...

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.290
What happened?

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:35.610
So, how was it?

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:36.490
For the time being,

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.620
I was able to talk him into
giving us another chance.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.720
The rest is up to the performer.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:43.930
Sora!

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:45.490
Hey, Sora!

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.840
The dining room will be closing soon!

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.040
If you don't eat,

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:50.870
you won't be able to heal quickly.

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.610
Please leave me alone.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:55.440
How truly pitiful.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:57.040
Oh, be quiet.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:59.680
Why did you skip today's practice?

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.550
I'm injured, you know.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.320
Why will you not come out from there?

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.620
My shoulder hurts.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:05.220
Why?

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.190
Who cares anyway? Just leave me alone.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.860
So, it is the same as that other time.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:12.060
That other time?

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.900
Once, there was a man who was
able to see me.

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:17.560
That man also became unable to jump
due to injuries,

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:21.000
for he was not able to overcome
the fear of when he injured himself.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.500
Was he able to appear on stage?

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:24.470
Yes.

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:29.340
How?!

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.450
How did he overcome his fear?!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.110
I see.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:34.520
So as I thought, your shoulder injury
has nothing to do with this.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.320
Never mind that!

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:37.050
How he did it?! Answer me!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.590
This is?

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.080
The Hanged Man.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.330
Sora,

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:46.390
if you want to change your current situation,

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:47.930
you cannot just keep running away.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.450
I'm not running...

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:54.360
The man gradually became
unable to see me.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:09.580
Oh...

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:11.850
This is?

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:13.820
Sora.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:14.790
Ken...

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:16.390
Just like I thought.

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:18.360
I knew you'd come, Sora.

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:20.790
Ken, I'm sorry about what I said earlier.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.600
Don't worry about it.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.570
It didn't bother me at all.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:26.100
Anyway, you're going to do it, right?

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:26.900
Practice, I mean.

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:27.570
What?

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:30.270
I got things ready because
I figured you'd be here.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.140
Got things ready... You mean this?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.010
Yeah, that's right.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.670
For your practice.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.480
For me?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.680
Yeah.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:41.350
I'm sorry I wasn't being
considerate of your feelings earlier.

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.520
Oh, no. I should apologize to you too.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:48.460
But don't you think these swings
are too low to provide a good practice?

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:51.530
No, I want you to gradually build your
successes starting from a low height

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.360
and get you to picture the
perfect image of yourself.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.960
The perfect image?

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.030
That's right.

00:14:57.030 --> 00:14:58.170
Do it over and over

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.670
until the image of failing
is erased from your mind.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.870
But still, don't you think
this height is just too easy?

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.070
Well, we'll see about that.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.940
What?!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:12.550
I can't do something like this, Ken!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.050
This is all for the sake of your
image of success.

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:16.180
Still...

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.120
I'll coordinate the timing,

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.680
so jump when I give you the signal.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.720
Are you ready, Sora? Here we go.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.030
Forget about the time you made a mistake,

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.190
and just focus on synchronizing
with the sound.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.430
Okay.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:42.670
Ready? One, two, three!

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:54.580
Are you all right, Sora?

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.920
No. I'm sorry, Ken.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.830
I can't do this!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.290
Sora, be strong!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.130
I can't do this.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.460
Sora, look at me!

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.960
Please trust me!

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:09.340
I'll lead you to success, I promise!

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.830
I can't rescue you heroically like Yuri did,

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.540
but I'll make sure to make you
the Little Mermaid!

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.040
Sora...

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:19.540
Okay. Thank you, Ken.

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.340
Then, one more time.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:22.750
Okay.

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.390
Well...

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:37.160
He is a Kung Fu Master, Master Linn.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:40.170
Master knows the breathing technique
for mental concentration,

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:42.400
so you should learn it and
improve your focus.

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:42.740
Dragon

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.310
Dragon

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.310
What?!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:45.770
Dragon

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:45.770
Don't whine, just do it.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:46.940
Dragon

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:47.480
Dragon

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:47.480
Look,

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.880
Dragon

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.880
Master Linn is saying he wants to test you.

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:50.470
Dragon

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:50.470
What?

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:55.220
He says if you can keep up with him,

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:57.740
he'll teach you the technique for
mental concentration.

00:16:58.220 --> 00:16:59.250
Oh, okay.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.580
Please don't be too hard on me.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:03.180
Oh, yes.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:07.590
Huh?

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:10.500
He says you passed the test.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.660
What? Already?

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:22.940
That's right.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:25.470
Take a deep breath and calm your emotions.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:29.620
I'm okay.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:30.880
One more time...

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.360
I can't do it right.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:44.560
That's not true at all.

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:48.870
Master Linn says that he is very
satisfied with your progress.

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:49.840
What?

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.180
That is the technique of mental
concentration!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.380
You're amazing, Sora!

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.370
I can't believe he's going to
teach you that technique!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.120
Come on, what are you doing?!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.520
Sora, hurry up and do what he's doing!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.750
Oh, yes!

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:15.730
Be one with nature and
resign yourself to nature.

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:19.670
Then, you will be the wind,
the water, and the earth.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:22.170
Abandon yourself and be
one with your surroundings.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:25.700
This is indeed the secret of
mental concentration.

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:30.980
Sora!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.450
Resign myself to nature...

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:38.250
You want to take a little break?

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.680
No, I'm fine.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.320
I think I'm almost there.

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:48.550
Well, I think you should be ready
to do this soon.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:52.370
But maybe I should do a little more
rehabilitation before...

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.360
The doctor's told me that you're
already completely recovered.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.200
Don't tell me you're afraid.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.480
If you're saying that you can't jump,

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.470
there's no point in you being here.

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:22.420
There's no point in you being here.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.570
Calm down, Sora.

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:26.030
You don't need to worry.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.530
Why?

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:29.530
Why can you say that?

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:33.170
You've worked hard all this time practicing!

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.640
It was a practice.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.300
That's why I could do it!

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:39.370
I probably won't be able to do anything
when it really counts.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:42.020
I can't jump anymore!

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:42.950
I'll probably...

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:45.340
I'll probably never jump again!

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.150
So, you're never going to jump
for the rest of your life?!

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.690
I still remember how I felt when I learned

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:55.320
that I would never be able to jump
because of my weak heart.

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:58.400
I can't jump even if I want to.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:00.100
And you're the same now, Sora.

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:02.760
But the truth is you CAN jump.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.210
When you were practicing the
Golden Phoenix,

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:08.840
I wondered why you could jump so happily

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.830
when the practice was so tough.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.750
There are many good performers
at Kaleido Stage,

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:17.250
but you're the first one who made me wish

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:18.720
that I could also jump like that.

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:23.120
Remember how it feels
when you're jumping, Sora.

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:30.060
How it feels when I'm jumping...

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.600
Don't give up, Sora.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:37.460
I don't want my Sora to be
defeated by her fears.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:44.580
Sora...

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.550
Thank you, Ken.

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:57.660
Sora?!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.970
A blindfold? Will she be all right?

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:07.960
Of course.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:09.670
Please begin.

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:10.600
Yes, sir.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:11.630
Here we go, Sora.

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.200
Are you ready?

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:15.440
Yup!

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:19.470
Go, Sora. One, two, three!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.000
If you're saying that you can't jump,

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.090
there's no point in you being here.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:47.000
Be one with nature and
resign yourself to nature.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.110
Be one with your surroundings.

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:52.440
Then, you shall be the sky,
just as you were named.

00:21:57.220 --> 00:21:58.740
Wonderful!

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:08.230
You did it, Sora.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:13.870
You really are the most radiant person
at this Kaleido Stage.

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:24.650
<i>When you're lonely, what do you do?</i>

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:24.650
<i>When you sabishii toki doushitemasuka</i>

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:27.080
<i>Never say you don't get any of that</i>

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:27.080
<i>Never say sonna no wakannai</i>

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:29.950
<i>Sleep, play, flip through a magazine</i>

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:29.950
<i>Nemuru asobu magazine mekuru</i>

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:32.290
<i>When you're lonely, you're lonely</i>

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:32.290
<i>Sabishii toki wa sabishii yo</i>

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:37.060
<i>Like always, invisible vibes fly around
the city today, tulututu</i>

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:37.060
<i>Mienai denpa ga kyou mo
tulututu machi ni tobikau</i>

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:41.730
<i>Anyway, the vector of my heart is
talking about so many reasons</i>

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:41.730
<i>Anyway kokoro no bekutoru
so many reason hanashiteru</i>

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>I want to be free and fly the skies</i>

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>Jiyuu ni sora o tobitai keredo</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:51.110
<i>But I don't have space to spread my wings</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:51.110
<i>Hane o hirogeru basho ga nai</i>

00:22:51.110 --> 00:22:53.270
<i>But I have faith</i>

00:22:51.110 --> 00:22:53.270
<i>Demo shinjiteru</i>

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.980
<i>There is a future yet to be shaped</i>

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.980
<i>Katachi no nai mirai ga aru yo</i>

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:02.650
<i>And there's a me that I want to shape</i>

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:02.650
<i>Katachi ni shitai watashi ga iru</i>

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:09.120
<i>Even if I'm sad, even if it's a mistake</i>

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:09.120
<i>Kanashikutemo machigai demo</i>

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.460
<i>I'll do what I want and
fly towards the freedom</i>

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.460
<i>Omou mama fly to the free</i>

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:22.270
Next Kaleido Star

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:25.010
Go, Sora! You're the leading lady!

00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:27.110
And so, this is my first leading role.

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:29.640
I tried performing it perfectly
like Miss Layla, but...

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:31.410
Fewer people are coming to see us...

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:33.210
And the sponsor doesn't like it either.

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:37.840
Oh, what in the world am I doing wrong?
What? What?

00:23:38.320 --> 00:23:42.620
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"Facing An Amazing Wall"

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:43.090
Facing An Amazing Wall

00:23:43.090 --> 00:23:45.420
Facing An Amazing Wall

00:23:43.090 --> 00:23:45.420
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...
